            <div xml:id="d727">

                <pb facs="1007" n="871" sameAs="frus:frus1929v01/pg871"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/663: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Schoenfeld</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-08-22T18:00:00-03:00">August 22, 1929—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 6:30 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>39. Brazilian Minister for Foreign Affairs personally and confidentially informed
                    this afternoon of the contents of the Department’s telegram number 50, August
                    21, 6 p.m., and stated that his Government would be glad to cooperate fully
                    along the lines suggested.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schoenfeld</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
